  "brief": {
    "zh": "手里是旧清单，原计划装 6 个转接头、3 个保险丝和 2 个防尘盖。仓库通知把转接头减到 4 个，并取消防尘盖。维修负责人随后签字，只把保险丝改为 5 个，加 1 张验收卡。两份通知没提到的项目沿用前一版，检测笔留在货架。请 AI 修订清单，每轮指出全部差异，再确认最终清单。",
    "en": "The old manifest calls for 6 adaptors, 3 fuses, and 2 dust caps. Receiving then cuts the adaptors to 4 and cancels the caps. The repair lead signs a later change that only raises fuses to 5 and adds 1 audit card. Keep all requirements unchanged by each bulletin. Leave the test probe on the shelf. Have AI revise the manifest, flag every discrepancy per round, then approve the final manifest."
  },
